      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63382",
      ":question/problem": "Jeremy spent all day in a field with a GPS navigator. He recorded his coordinates every time that he changed direction. The following ordered pairs were recorded:\n\n$(0, 0), (0, 3), (-2, 3), (-2,-2), (4,-2)$\n\nIf one unit corresponds to one kilometer, then what is the total distance that Jeremy traveled?"
